In this episode of Making Chocolate Ice Cream, we look at cocoa powders and chocolate types and discuss the differences and how to's. 

What we've used here :

Callebaut 70.5% Chocolate
Callebaut White Chocolate 22
Barima 56% Semi Sweet Chocolate
Barima 35% Milk Chocolate
Becolade 55% Semi Sweet Chocolate
Becolade 35% Milk Chocolate
Wonka Bar........

The cocoa powders are:
Callebaut 24% fat
IRCA 22-24% fat
deZaan 12% fat

